OL,3,AFarage says #72m donations are
OL,4,Acompliant 'with the law today'
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK leader Nigel Farage has said
OL,7,Ftwo big donations given to his party
OL,8,Fare "100% compliant with the law
OL,9,Ftoday", but was not able say whether
OL,10,Fthey would be permissible if a rule
OL,11,Fchange, currently being debated in
OL,12,FParliament, were passed.
OL,14,FMinisters are seeking to put a #100,000
OL,15,Fannual cap on donations from British
OL,16,Fexpats, backdated to 25 March 2026.
OL,18,FFarage argued the government should not
OL,19,Fretrospectively declare donations
OL,20,Fillegal and threatened to retaliate by
OL,21,Flimiting trade union donations, if
OL,22,Felected PM.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
