OL,3,AFarage says #72m donations are
OL,4,Acompliant 'with the law today'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrade union leader Paul Nowak said
OL,7,Fthere was no similarity between "care
OL,8,Fworkers chipping in a few quid a year
OL,9,Fthrough their union and a party bought
OL,10,Fand paid for by billionaires."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
