OL,3,AChina criticises idea it is in
OL,4,A'malicious competition' over AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina has hit out against what it has
OL,7,Fcalled "threat narratives" over AI
OL,8,Fgovernance and warned against "engaging
OL,9,Fin confrontation and malicious
OL,10,Fcompetition".
OL,12,FIt follows Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei's
OL,13,Fcalls for a slowdown in AI development
OL,14,F- but in a way that prevents China from
OL,15,Fpulling ahead in the AI race.
OL,17,FOver the past week, industry insiders
OL,18,Fat the leading US artificial
OL,19,Fintelligence labs have been warning in
OL,20,Fextremely stark terms about the
OL,21,Fpotential threat AI poses, with some
OL,22,Fsaying it could wipe out humanity.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
